<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Perpetual has Loscam stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Perpetual has Loscam stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perpetual Trustees Australia Ltd said on Friday that it had become a substantial shareholder in pallet group and takeover target Loscam Ltd with a stake of 5.23 percent.</p>
<p>Loscam is the subject of an agreed 43 cent per share bid by Ge Capital Services, a unit of General Electric Co.</p>
<p>The GE bid values Loscam at A$54 million and is subject to a 90 percent minimum acceptance condition. GE now has 81.29 percent.</p>
<p>Loscam shares were steady at 43.5 cents on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
